n- V5：`后回与袭人供奉玉兄宝卿得同终始`；\n- “供奉”锁照应关系，不锁大额救济、同住或恢复阶级。：袭人蒋玉菡后期照应宝玉宝钗；O04贫寒相位开放。湘云/若兰仍O06开放。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[41151,41347],"lines":[1030,1032],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"dc3cd383fee0133c3409d89f7e4404e402549069d08f926d39dc26f1aadc4646"},"name":"最强处","number":2,"text":"**2｜最强处**  \n袭人敲门、蒋玉菡站门外不抢戏；戏业生计完整；援助物多钱少；湘云长信里婚后生活与“写两句揉掉”；新旧米同淘、仍两碗半。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[41347,41450],"lines":[1033,1035],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"5d7be63035e663b59f92a7a999e6de1ccd5453a75876ae5bac86b89480c58d3b"},"name":"最薄处","number":3,"text":"**3｜最薄处**  \n袭人如何知道地址、蒋为何同行、湘云信如何转递可补很轻。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[41450,41592],"lines":[1036,1038],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"5370e9ec10523670b884650f3380fdf4820b44af93d84c66b5697264cabf11dc"},"name":"缺失情节","number":4,"text":"**4｜缺失情节**  \n96-S1贾芸/花家旧人转地址；S2蒋正好有现实理由同行；S3宝钗分配援助；S4信件延迟路径。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[41592,41668],"lines":[1039,1041],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"818b3da12b7774ef5e1223244715c6f8f88d6f436128e34f6832fd288f8870e1"},"name":"人物","number":5,"text":"**5｜人物**  \n袭人、蒋、贾芸、宝钗麝月宝玉；送信人。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[41668,41770],"lines":[1042,1044],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"c775415659cb2d13e9424decfb59ef38f379be99e3d4b0de1dc03cd235784492"},"name":"文化","number":6,"text":"**6｜文化**  \n96戏曲职业世界、湘云被生活切断的诗性均P-Lock；不当场唱曲。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[41770,41904],"lines":[1045,1047],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"676c911f34cdf99f1adc4c9e8d105431e5277f604baf1308987615926849d044"},"name":"诗文身份","number":7,"text":"**7｜诗文身份**  \nG03完整湘云新诗淘汰；揉掉的两句不恢复。信是实用/人物声口文字，不冒充佚诗。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[41904,41980],"lines":[1048,1050],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"55047834fc6c02f7760cb18b54e8dca122aef24599cd40c6860b2634cd02aba6"},"name":"笑料","number":8,"text":"**8｜笑料**  \n淡茶、松子、两碗半、纸边沾饭气等保护。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[41980,42009],"lines":[1051,1053],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"52cc0014f985e00517b0b7ada40265d28a0c61b13fb49010dd5f8f76b40e4b31"},"name":"宗教/梦","number":9,"text":"**9｜宗教/梦**  \n低。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[42009,42137],"lines":[1054,1056],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"cb7cecc43f3a2b5a43ba6bf343f2fdc8c89be0ed0c1ec49fa0d5d9e2b26b9c0d"},"name":"职业","number":10,"text":"**10｜职业**  \n蒋有登台、教唱、行头、嗓子、同行和收入周期；不要把他变“旧友友情客串”。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[42137,42252],"lines":[1057,1059],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"c0716ef332ecc10314322c98da6de937bacc166a56c734f4e06e10aa51d7efe6"},"name":"四链","number":11,"text":"**11｜四链**  \nE4：援助只能缓解；米、炭、一点碎银，不赎回阶级。信件有转递时间。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[42252,42363],"lines":[1060,1062],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"3ce548c361059810c314274f1dfe95d917f8127986d53f3faa0a18ddb7f4599c"},"name":"必须保留","number":12,"text":"**12｜必须保留**  \n袭/蒋/麝 teasing；便宜油膏；银子先收；两碗半不变；春菜叫卖。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[42363,42440],"lines":[1063,1065],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"e6d0a4027d4c68ee2beecefa02165d4a09996fa5ffab9bfa8fa27fb589c2340e"},"name":"应删","number":13,"text":"**13｜应删**  \n大笔银钱；蒋唱整折戏；湘云完整婚后诗。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[42440,42471],"lines":[1066,1068],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"c6f2ac7e83d87120796bcdfad66b71be698dc35408a78deaca4ad009b60a7c42"},"name":"L3","number":14,"text":"**14｜L3**  \n无，L1—2。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[42471,42565],"lines":[1069,1071],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"b9532267343142c18ef12257e812ac98fc0e6ff6edbb51486dc7299933e7ddbb"},"name":"前80同构","number":15,"text":"**15｜前80同构**  \n28汗巾/蒋袭伏线在贫困现实中回收，不写命运宣言。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[42565,42593],"lines":[1072,1072],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"e1c22a397f53f3d123997c31bccf5dc898e2eee9267dc54c723ff51c44ba4ad3"},"name":"回前诗","number":16,"text":"**16｜回前诗** 无。  \n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[42593,42620],"lines":[1073,1074],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"4ce526aecba789d8fb664d11031ea1dcfb21bf96efab2e4510b2cee0f78d282d"},"name":"回末诗","number":17,"text":"**17｜回末诗** 无。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[42620,42880],"lines":[1075,1078],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"8832c9bcf625976cfbdd882062f9389a0bec721ddae393d26670e34ced117b8a"},"name":"章法 / 风险","number":18,"text":"**18｜章法 / 风险**  \n贫居春日 → 袭人到门 → 故人相见 → 蒋职业生活只露够用的一层 → 援助分配 → 湘云信到 → “两句揉掉” → 新旧米同锅。  \n**风险：**故人援助恢复阶级；文化展示过满。\n\n"}],"chapter":96,"entry_ref":null,"evidence_effect":"NONE","existing_contracts":[],"exit_ref":null,"open_refs":[],"order_basis":"SOURCE_LIST_ORDER_NOT_VERIFIED_CHRONOLOGY","protections":["data/implementation_alignment/m6.json#/chapter_protections/15"],"scenes":[{"id":"96-S1","order":1,"ref":"data/planning/scenes/96-S1.json"},{"id":"96-S2","order":2,"ref":"data/planning/scenes/96-S2.json"},{"id":"96-S3","order":3,"ref":"data/planning/scenes/96-S3.json"},{"id":"96-S4","order":4,"ref":"data/planning/scenes/96-S4.json"}],"source":{"byte_range":[40568,42885],"lines":[1016,1080],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"52b2f4fa02f214e855d874cb184d6b9807322fc80d52b71b694b7a20997e8d5d"},"source_records":[{"path":"data/reconstruction/m2.json","pointer":"/chapters/15","ref":"data/reconstruction/m2.json#/chapters/15","sha256":"345b9572314ef414c1b4b4892126a57a89b335bdb0a756fa9d2e89a909d6939f","text_sha256":"0b98dc241f103067eea09ab804f8108cec2fcfd861a05708c066cdda038bc183","value":{"anchor_refs":["R25","R26","P08"],"chapter":96,"field_schema_ref":"chapter-card-18-fields-v2.5","key_constraints":["蒋玉菡袭人援助小而实用","援助不能逆转持续贫困","湘云家书保留生活气而不补完整诗篇"],"pressure_test":false,"semantic_coverage":"PARTIAL_STRUCTURED","source_lines":[1016,1080],"source_ref":"asset:sha256:cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","title":"花袭人携夫问故人　史湘云寄札叙家常","title_status":"TG_WORKING"}},{"path":"data/reconstruction/m2.js