银压匣、新旧米同淘、两碗半。","plan_class":"B级轻补","risk":"大笔银钱、恢复阶级、怀旧大会。","source_ref":"asset:sha256:cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","title_source":"TG工作回目"}},{"path":"data/implementation_alignment/m6.json","pointer":"/chapter_protections/15","ref":"data/implementation_alignment/m6.json#/chapter_protections/15","sha256":"f9ba473eb93d8639d2cc9639aa67a698010cee8d1da20b05ebf81eb897bf0fe1","text_sha256":"ee9e9f3f558e0d0fd473d76502a93beb5c0461442f61068973a1655ada1a1d67","value":{"allowed_additions":"蒋玉菡职业戏曲、湘云婚后诗性","chapter":96,"forbidden_drift":"援助不逆转贫困；袭人不说回来住；不怀旧大会","level":"P1/P2","must_preserve":"袭人蒋玉菡麝月互揭短；便宜油膏；碎银压匣；新米仍两碗半；卖春菜声","source_ref":"asset:sha256:626917a3603d00697ccb86e6be8d1bb5b40911ffad700436ea836cd8e6336261"}},{"path":"data/prewrite/v06.json","pointer":"/gap_cards/15","ref":"data/prewrite/v06.json#/gap_cards/15","sha256":"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff","text_sha256":"7c10c3c11e7b008273546be8171210ed1527fbbb6d68e298f4a2d184ada7d696","value":{"chapter":96,"priority":"第二批","source_ref":"asset:sha256:faae6f996071b532940ceddfdd55830df7eb60a59d98ee167f725dffd7b4f3d0","source_symbols":{"arts":"▲","body":"—","chapter_frame":"✓","comic_folk":"✓","dream_symbol":"✓","economy":"△","main_process":"△","metaphysics":"—","minor_agents":"✓","poetry":"▲","ritual":"△","secondary_plot":"✓"},"states":{"arts":"MISSING","body":"NOT_APPLICABLE","chapter_frame":"SUFFICIENT","comic_folk":"SUFFICIENT","dream_symbol":"SUFFICIENT","economy":"THIN","main_process":"THIN","metaphysics":"NOT_APPLICABLE","minor_agents":"SUFFICIENT","poetry":"MISSING","ritual":"THIN","secondary_plot":"SUFFICIENT"}}},{"path":"data/prewrite/v06.json","pointer":"/omitted_scene_plans/15","ref":"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/15","sha256":"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff","text_sha256":"12381c17efe3bb2a3b38fcd6ba1ab8f4197aba73f031b391fadb0d8c647eab21","value":{"action":"加桥","candidate_scenes":[{"id":"96-S1","title":"袭人不是凭空知道地址"},{"id":"96-S2","title":"蒋玉菡是否同行要有自己的理由"},{"id":"96-S3","title":"援助被宝钗重新分配，而不是立刻消费"},{"id":"96-S4","title":"湘云的信有真实传递路径"}],"chapter":96,"core_process":"故人怎样找到寒家；有限援助怎样进入而不逆转贫困","handoff":"40、38、37","intensity":"中低","source_ref":"asset:sha256:4e1dd2a2d7669011ece72f8d7a5b93903b235042aadd528f0178f6544901dc7b"}},{"path":"data/literary_ecology/m5.json","pointer":"/author_rhyme_chapters/15","ref":"data/literary_ecology/m5.json#/author_rhyme_chapters/15","sha256":"9fbc4013d0c42c957516af85e726180441ed54548d0ec4366f832fdd9f5696e4","text_sha256":"2665bfc2792f6acfe2778d901e19f9f92e5f7a4fdb26d39423f75d9d16346fce","value":{"chapter":96,"ending_anchor":"新旧米同淘","mode":"散文收","source_ref":"asset:sha256:fc421b406baee7946b3d3bf4291c59678bfb09a04d13939c9e80199f157e7674","winner":"C"}}],"status":"DRAFT_IMPORTED","threads":[],"title":"花袭人携夫问故人　史湘云寄札叙家常","title_status":"TG工作回目","unresolved":["entry_ref","exit_ref","threads","open_refs","scene_chronology","existing_contract_placement"]},"exemplar_dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","exemplars":[{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":27,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":568,"start":516,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:393"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:27","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:27:p00128","selection_reason":"第27回小红回凤姐话：观察丫鬟传话时的多层称谓与回话。","text":"红玉道：“平姐姐说：我们奶奶问这里奶奶\n好。原是我们二爷不在家，虽然迟了两天，只管请奶奶放心。\n等五奶奶","text_sha256":"bb37f7c183903e29f1ca30ab22c782708924b29b9c782620ec07536238c09150"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":24,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":762,"start":659,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:344"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:24","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:24:p00066","selection_reason":"第24回贾芸求舅舅赊货：观察差事、银钱与人物声口。","text":"原来卜世仁现开香料铺，方才从铺子里来，忽\n见贾芸进来，彼此见过了，因问他这早晚什么事跑了来。贾芸\n道：“有件事求舅舅帮衬帮衬。我有一件事，用些冰片麝香使\n用，好歹舅舅每样赊四两给我，八月里按数送了银子来。”","text_sha256":"add8d8d7a9b14836a9ea90a162eccde4752ba78fd1221c9006060b667c18166a"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":74,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":493,"start":63,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:1013"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:74","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:74:p00079","selection_reason":"第74回抄检：观察同一事件中的身份与群像差异。","text":"遂命众丫\n鬟秉烛开门而待。一时，众人来了。探春故问何事。凤姐笑道：\n“因丢了一件东西，连日访察不出人来，恐怕旁人赖这些女孩\n子们，所以越性大家搜一搜，使人去疑，倒是洗净他们的好法\n子。”探春冷笑道：“我们的丫头自然都是些贼，我就是头一\n个窝主。既如此，先来搜我的箱柜，他们所有偷了来的都交给\n我藏着呢。”说着便命丫头们把箱柜一齐打开，将镜奁、妆盒、\n衾袱、衣包若大若小之物一齐打开，请凤姐去抄阅。凤姐陪笑\n道：“我不过是奉太太的命来，妹妹别错怪我。何必生气。”\n因命丫鬟们快快关上。 \n  平儿丰儿等忙着替待书等关的关，收的收。探春道：“我\n的东西倒许你们搜阅，要想搜我的丫头，这却不能。我原比众\n人歹毒，凡丫头所有的东西我都知道，都在我这里间收着，一\n针一线他们也没的收藏，要搜所以只来搜我。你们不依，只管\n去回太太，只说我违背了太太，该怎么处治，我去自领。你们\n别忙，自然连你们抄的日子有呢！你们今日早起不曾议论甄家，\n自己家里好好的抄家，果然今日真抄了。","text_sha256":"139d8b797c42c19fd3ff5e9d961f882631751c60bfaeebe490d77a9da83e392d"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":61,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":795,"start":45,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:820"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:61","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:61:p00020","selection_reason":"第61回平儿处理失窃案：观察真相、体面与处理办法。","text":"恐次日有变，大家先起了个清早，都悄悄的来买转平儿，一面\n送些东西，一面又奉承他办事简断，一面又讲述他母亲素日许\n多不好。平儿一一的都应着，打发他们去了，却悄悄的来访袭\n人，问他可果真芳官给他露了。袭人便说：“露却是给芳官，\n芳官转给何人我却不知。”袭人于是又问芳官，芳官听了，唬\n天跳地，忙应是自己送他的。芳官便又告诉了宝玉，宝玉也慌\n了，说：“露虽有了，若勾起茯苓霜来，他自然也实供。若听\n见了是他舅舅门上得的，他舅舅又有了不是，岂不是人家的好\n意，反被咱们陷害了。”因忙和平儿计议：“露的事虽完，然\n这霜也是有不是的。好姐姐，你叫他说也是芳官给他的就完\n了。”平儿笑道：“虽如此，只是他昨晚已经同人说是他舅舅\n给的了，如何又说你给的？况且那边所丢的露也是无主儿，如\n今有赃证的白放了，又去找谁？谁还肯认？众人也未必心服。”\n晴雯走来笑道：“太太那边的露再无别人，分明是彩云偷了给\n环哥儿去了。你们可瞎乱说。”平儿笑道：“谁不知是这个原\n故，但今玉钏儿急的哭，悄悄问着他，他若应了，玉钏也罢了，\n大家也就混着不问了。难道我们好意兜揽这事不成！可恨彩云\n不但不应，他还挤玉钏儿，说他偷了去了。两个人窝里发炮，\n先吵的合府皆知，我们如何装没事人。少不得要查的。殊不知\n告失盗的就是贼，又没赃证，怎么说他。” \n  宝玉道：“也罢，这件事我也应起来，就说是我唬他们顽\n的，悄悄的偷了太太的来了。两件事都完了。”袭人道：“也\n倒是件阴骘事，保全人的贼名儿。只是太太听见又说你小孩子\n气，不知好歹了。”平儿笑道：“这也倒是小事。如今便从赵\n姨娘屋里起了赃来也容易，我只怕又伤着一个好人的体面。别\n人都别管，这一个人岂不又生气。我可怜的是他，不肯为了打\n老鼠伤了玉瓶。”说着，把三个指头一伸。袭人等听说，便知\n","text_sha256":"1f791b115b1d1a5e5b2768f3046b4dfeed1d4a2175fa8d26b04bb1d39095da98"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":52,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":713,"start":37,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:709"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:52","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:52:p00052","selection_reason":"第52回雀金裘被烧、晴雯病补：观察物质动作推动场面。","text":"刚安静了些。只见宝玉回来，进门就嗐声跺脚。麝月忙问原故，\n宝玉道：“今儿老太太喜喜欢欢的给了这个褂子，谁知不防后\n襟子上烧了一块，幸而天晚了，老太太、太太都不理论。”一\n面说，一面脱下来。麝月瞧时，果见有指头大的烧眼，说：“这\n必定是手炉里的火迸上了。这不值什么，赶着叫人悄悄的拿出\n去，叫个能干织补匠人织上就是了。”说着便用包袱包了，交\n与一个妈妈送出去。说：“赶天亮就有才好。千万别给老太太、\n太太知道。”婆子去了半日，仍旧拿回来，说：“不但能干织\n补匠人，就连裁缝绣匠并作女工的问了，都不认得这是什么，\n都不敢揽。”麝月道：“这怎么样呢！明儿不穿也罢了。”宝\n玉道：“明儿是正日子，老太太、太太说了，还叫穿这个去呢。\n偏头一日烧了，岂不扫兴。” \n  晴雯听了半日，忍不住翻身说道：“拿来我瞧瞧罢。没个\n福气穿就罢了，这会子又着急。”宝玉笑道：“这话倒说的是。”\n说着，便递与晴雯，又移过灯来，细看了一会。晴雯道：“这\n是孔雀金线织的，如今咱们也拿孔雀金线就像界线似的界密了，\n只怕还可混得过去。”麝月笑道：“孔雀线现成的，但这里除\n了你，还有谁会界线？”晴雯道：“说不得，我挣命罢了。”\n宝玉忙道：“这如何使得！才好了些，如何做得活。”晴雯道：\n“不用你蝎蝎螫螫的，我自知道。”一面说，一面坐起来，挽\n了一挽头发，披了衣裳，只觉头重身轻，满眼金星乱迸，实实\n掌不住。若不做，又怕宝玉着急，少不得恨命咬牙捱着。便命\n麝月只帮着拈线。晴雯先拿了一根比一比，笑道：“这虽不很\n像，若补上，也不很显。”宝玉道：“这就很好，那里又找哦\n啰嘶国的裁缝去。”","text_sha256":"919dfdc9482c1dfa76b40d1ce9ff0cd53ae2738cea6d354fc47d381d3e04c525"}],"guidance":"Organize scene obligations and check entry/exit constraints before writing.","input_readiness":{"blockers":["CORPUS_HUMAN_LAYER_AUDIT_PENDING"],"scope":"FROZEN_RESEARCH_WRITING_INPUTS"},"operation_scope":"RESEARCH","package":{"assets":[{"asset_ref":"asset:sha256:23861cce04acb8308e2d9c19a38445cddbe985b41fc8f0458d965e2379309072","sha256":"23861cce04acb8308e2d9c19a38445cddbe985b41fc8f0458d965e2379309072"},{"asset_ref":"asset:sha256:626917a3603d00697ccb86e6be8d1bb5b40911ffad700436ea836cd8e6336261","sha256":"626917a3603d00697ccb86e6be8d1bb5b40911ffad700436ea836cd8e6336261"},{"asset_ref":"asset:sha256:66508dc74b1e09e9b0ad69f0cb781ae881505ee4f446075d85386bfb228205b7","sha256":"66508dc74b1e09e9b0ad69f0cb781ae881505ee4f446075d85386bfb228205b7"},{"asset_ref":"asset:sha256:6ab10932c4f8ae3580ec1f1db3034e8ba2fee58ae038db9556204ee11aeb0d44","sha256":"6ab10932c4f8ae3580ec1f1db3034e8ba2fee58ae038db9556204ee11aeb0d44"},{"asset_ref":"asset:sha256:c1946d9ff097372aa0583eec627a5f37ec77ec3b076fa2229c23f7f441bb7eb0","sha256":"c1946d9ff097372aa0583eec627a5f37ec77ec3b076fa2229c23f7f441bb7eb0"}],"authority_effect":"NONE","chapter":96,"exemplar_set":{"path":"data/writing/exemplars/ch89-research-v3.json","sha256":"2989c8f10355a541e3388b5d3aad23e6c96e03ca2ccc6fe2ab9bfe0ab19f6b49"},"id":"writing-package:ch96:agent-research:v4","operation_scope":"RESEARCH","plan":[{"path":"data/project/plan_constraints_v1.json","sha256":"8f3ca1572c57e6440d94eb151680f189994b6c2097a5c02609b55e35a32b94cd"},{"path":"data/planning/chapters/ch96.json","sha256":"a16c88eecea1bbe2a0281b4c0073985994e9663e7d921b76a3f099064d764086"},{"path":"data/planning/contracts/agent-final-v1/96-S1.v2.json","sha256":"360170ff2d1d5062a82ed96ddfd2bed25316e6aac5bdd7636554e019c68aedf9"},{"path":"data/planning/contracts/agent-final-v1/96-S2.v2.json","sha256":"3b136329552976e18e831043504ed0b4f208a51270f2a443ef15d00894beba55"},{"path":"data/planning/contracts/agent-final-v1/96-S3.v2.json","sha256":"dfc46c494e79853745d3a6cde6f6a39e0f372573fd60e8994276307b17cbde30"},{"path":"data/planning/contracts/agent-final-v1/96-S4.v2.json","sha256":"0febc091720b6ddc1c801468f8a380ff34009c0347e3f584b18fe8b709922641"}],"purpose":"第96回全书会话研究试写：显式选择经模型编辑的场景合同版本。未知状态仍未验收，史料/语料/文学资格未授予；不修改稳定版。","schema_version":1,"sources":[],"world":[{"path":"data/world/m3_body.json","sha256":"429ca248ea42aa0601e11a55d40fa446da92cee48936627a83b335ab9b18056e"},{"path":"data/world/m3_core.json","sha256":"c4bf1c75fda8994fd846e570a64ae69efeb6ca17cd27e78c1bb1af4d7783d733"},{"path":"data/world/m3_knowledge.json","sha256":"d8ee374ec667317af6ef304dc4b66ad7d3ceae9f20753c1b35cf029c73dee18b"},{"path":"data/world/m3_locations.json","sha256":"ed1a4053f1459193777f486b3a9743c5aec28afb7d027dee12684da6e3a9d81b"},{"path":"data/world/m3_presence.json","sha256":"7880480b001c321e50056e887f1285f6c7ccf975aed140d1515967ea925bb3bb"},{"path":"data/world/m3_resources.json","sha256":"b823f72594d4a2af2216525cbfd3411b00d41c4ad0fa89830348933be6de7668"}]},"plan":{"data/planning/chapters/ch96.json":{"authority_effect":"NONE","card_fields":[{"citation":{"byte_range":[40868,41151],"lines":[1023,1029],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"4e1dfebff884225a9db0a5e67e733e67da9491c353b277cad34eae7ed88ccaf4"},"name":"硬节点","number":1,"text":"**1｜硬节点**  \nR25/R26\n\n**V-INTERFACES｜**\n- V5：`后回与袭人供奉玉兄宝卿得同终始`；\n- “供奉”锁照应关系，不锁大额救济、同住或恢复阶级。：袭人蒋玉菡后期照应宝玉宝钗；O04贫寒相位开放。湘云/若兰仍O06开放。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[41151,41347],"lines":[1030,1032],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"dc3cd383fee0133c3409d89f7e4404e402549069d08f926d39dc26f1aadc4646"},"name":"最强处","number":2,"text":"**2｜最强处**  \n袭人敲门、蒋玉菡站门外不抢戏；戏业生计完整；援助物多钱少；湘云长信里婚后生活与“写两句揉掉”；新旧米同淘、仍两碗半。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[41347,41450],"lines":[1033,1035],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"5d7be63035e663b59f92a7a999e6de1ccd5453a75876ae5bac86b89480c58d3b"},"name":"最薄处","number":3,"text":"**3｜最薄处**  \n袭人如何知道地址、蒋为何同行、湘云信如何转递可补很轻。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[41450,41592],"lines":[1036,1038],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"5370e9ec10523670b884650f3380fdf4820b44af93d84c66b5697264cabf11dc"},"name":"缺失情节","number":4,"text":"**4｜缺失情节**  \n96-S1贾芸/花家旧人转地址；S2蒋正好有现实理由同行；S3宝钗分配援助；S4信件延迟路径。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[41592,41668],"lines":[1039,1041],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"818b3da12b7774ef5e1223244715c6f8f88d6f436128e34f6832fd288f8870e1"},"name":"人物","number":5,"text":"**5｜人物**  \n袭人、蒋、贾芸、宝钗麝月宝玉；送信人。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[41668,41770],"lines":[1042,1044],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"c775415659cb2d13e9424decfb59ef38f379be99e3d4b0de1dc03cd235784492"},"name":"文化","number":6,"text":"**6｜文化**  \n96戏曲职业世界、湘云被生活切断的诗性均P-Lock；不当场唱曲。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[41770,41904],"lines":[1045,1047],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"676c911f34cdf99f1adc4c9e8d105431e5277f604baf1308987615926849d044"},"name":"诗文身份","number":7,"text":"**7｜诗文身份**  \nG03完整湘云新诗淘汰；揉掉的两句不恢复。信是实用/人物声口文字，不冒充佚诗。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[41904,41980],"lines":[1048,1050],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"55047834fc6c02f7760cb18b54e8dca122aef24599cd40c6860b2634cd02aba6"},"name":"笑料","number":8,"text":"**8｜笑料**  \n淡茶、松子、两碗半、纸边沾饭气等保护。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[41980,42009],"lines":[1051,1053],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"52cc0014f985e00517b0b7ada40265d28a0c61b13fb49010dd5f8f76b40e4b31"},"name":"宗教/梦","number":9,"text":"**9｜宗教/梦**  \n低。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[42009,42137],"lines":[1054,1056],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"cb7cecc43f3a2b5a43ba6bf343f2fdc8c89be0ed0c1ec49fa0d5d9e2b26b9c0d"},"name":"职业","number":10,"text":"**10｜职业**  \n蒋有登台、教唱、行头、嗓子、同行和收入周期；不要把他变“旧友友情客串”。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[42137,42252],"lines":[1057,1059],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"c0716ef332ecc10314322c98da6de937bacc166a56c734f4e06e10aa51d7efe6"},"name":"四链","number":11,"text":"**11｜四链**  \nE4：援助只能缓解；米、炭、一点碎银，不赎回阶级。信件有转递时间。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[42252,42363],"lines":[1060,1062],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"3ce548c361059810c314274f1dfe95d917f8127986d53f3faa0a18ddb7f4599c"},"name":"必须保留","number":12,"text":"**12｜必须保留**  \n袭/蒋/麝 teasing；便宜油膏；银子先收；两碗半不变；春菜叫卖。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[42363,42440],"lines":[1063,1065],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"e6d0a4027d4c68ee2beecefa02165d4a09996fa5ffab9bfa8fa27fb589c2340e"},"name":"应删","number":13,"text":"**13｜应删**  \n大笔银钱；蒋唱整折戏；湘云完整婚后诗。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[42440,42471],"lines":[1066,1068],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"c6f2ac7e83d87120796bcdfad66b71be698dc35408a78deaca4ad009b60a7c42"},"name":"L3","number":14,"text":"**14｜L3**  \n无，L1—2。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[42471,42565],"lines":[1069,1071],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"b9532267343142c18ef12257e812ac98fc0e6ff6edbb51486dc7299933e7ddbb"},"name":"前80同构","number":15,"text":"**15｜前80同构**  \n28汗巾/蒋袭伏线在贫困现实中回收，不写命运宣言。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[42565,42593],"lines":[1072,1072],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"e1c22a397f53f3d123997c31bccf5dc898e2eee9267dc54c723ff51c44ba4ad3"},"name":"回前诗","number":16,"text":"**16｜回前诗** 无。  \n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[42593,42620],"lines":[1073,1074],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"4ce526aecba789d8fb664d11031ea1dcfb21bf96efab2e4510b2cee0f78d282d"},"name":"回末诗","number":17,"text":"**17｜回末诗** 无。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[42620,42880],"lines":[1075,1078],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"8832c9bcf625976cfbdd882062f9389a0bec721ddae393d26670e34ced117b8a"},"name":"章法 / 风险","number":18,"text":"**18｜章法 / 风险**  \n贫居春日 → 袭人到门 → 故人相见 → 蒋职业生活只露够用的一层 → 援助分配 → 湘云信到 → “两句揉掉” → 新旧米同锅。  \n**风险：**故人援助恢复阶级；文化展示过满。\n\n"}],"chapter":96,"entry_ref":null,"evidence_effect":"NONE","existing_contracts":[],"exit_ref":null,"open_refs":[],"order_basis":"SOURCE_LIST_ORDER_NOT_VERIFIED_CHRONOLOGY","protections":["data/implementation_alignment/m6.json#/chapter_protections/15"],"scenes":[{"id":"96-S1","order":1,"ref":"data/planning/scenes/96-S1.json"},{"id":"96-S2","order":2,"ref":"data/planning/scenes/96-S2.json"},{"id":"96-S3","order":3,"ref":"data/planning/scenes/96-S3.json"},{"id":"96-S4","order":4,"ref":"data/planning/scenes/96-S4.json"}],"source":{"byte_range":[40568,42885],"lines":[1016,1080],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"52b2f4fa02f214e855d874cb184d6b9807322fc80d52b71b694b7a20997e8d5d"},"source_records":[{"path":"data/reconstruction/m2.json","pointer":"/chapters/15","ref":"data/reconstruction/m2.json#/chapters/15","sha256":"345b9572314ef414c1b4b4892126a57a89b335bdb0a756fa9d2e89a909d6939f","text_sha256":"0b98dc241f103067eea09ab804f8108cec2fcfd861a05708c066cdda038bc183","value":{"anchor_refs":["R25","R26","P08"],"chapter":96,"field_schema_ref":"chapter-card-18-fields-v2.5","key_constraints":["蒋玉菡袭人援助小而实用","援助不能逆转持续贫困","湘云家书保留生活气而不补完整诗篇"],"pressure_test":false,"